      "cooked": "<p>Heroic Infinitor vs. Setback, Naturalist, Lifeline and Xtreme Prime Wardens Argent Adept at The Block.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b\" title=\"0EC69F1D-0515-42DD-BEF5-D299321527E1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"0EC69F1D-0515-42DD-BEF5-D299321527E1\" data-base62-sha1=\"6fWMAIx1FwEY6HFIr0kKJAFdybh\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2bda8e267a6a0ad773518c753e1c1082b2afc22b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">0EC69F1D-0515-42DD-BEF5-D299321527E1</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 99.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>“Infintor, you bloodsucker. You’re gonna have to do your own dirty work now, do you hear me? Do you?”</p>\n<p>The fun parody intros keep coming. An easy mint- with an unusual emphasis on easy, winning on Infinitor’s second turn. I’m not sure games can get much faster than that!</p>",
